Phases: PHASE2; Conditions: ['Women With Primary Breast Cancer']; Drug: ['fec (fluorouracil', 'epirubicin', 'cyclophosphamide) + filgrastim + paclitaxel']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

