Phases: PHASE1, PHASE2; Conditions: ['Bladder Cancer']; Drug: ['gemcitabine', 'e7389', 'cisplatin']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria

Patients may be entered in the study only if they meet all of the following criteria:

