Phases: PHASE2; Conditions: ['Malignant Neoplasm of Stomach Stage IV']; Drug: ['pof', 'folfox', 'folfox plus pac(ip)']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion criteria:

1. Age 18-75 years;
