13. Have received another experimental drug or device within 30 days of Visit 1.; SMILES: ['[H][C@@]1(C)C[C@@]2([H])[C@]3([H])CCC4=CC(=O)C=C[C@]4(C)[C@@]3(Cl)[C@@]([H])(O)C[C@]2(C)[C@@]1(OC(=O)C1=CC=CO1)C(=O)CCl']; icd_code: [None]

Phases: PHASE2; Conditions: ['Prostate Cancer']; Drug: ['metformin']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

