    1. Serum creatinine \> 3.0 mg/dl (\> 265 µmol/L);
    2. Aspartate aminotransferase (ASAT) or alanine aminotransferase (ALAT) \> 3 x upper limit of normal,
    3. Hemoglobin (Hb) \< 10 g/dL,
